    "sections": {
        "description": "Laundry Services is designed for laundry and dry cleaning businesses that require a clear and structured website layout. The homepage features a prominent banner section with heading text, supporting description, and a call-to-action button. The theme includes a navigation menu with Home, About, Service, Page, Blog, and Contact sections, along with an appointment button in the header. A social media display area is provided within the banner section. A dedicated services section highlights key offerings such as Wash &amp; Fold, Wash &amp; Iron, Dry Cleaning, and Commercial Laundry. Each service is presented with an image, short description, and a read more button. The layout organizes service categories in a clean card-based structure for straightforward content presentation. This theme provides a simple foundation for presenting laundry-related services and business information in an organized format."
    },
